   "text": "notebook  -> reads ~/spark-lab-data/shared/silver/events   (hardcoded, so Lab 2's notebook must run first)\npipeline  -> reads $DAT535_OUTPUT_DIR/shared/silver/events  (so CI can point dev/prod at separate roots)",
