   "x": 1308,
   "y": 1442,
   "width": 388.8,
   "height": 22.5,
   "text": "Why caching lost here - and when it wins",
   "originalText": "Why caching lost here - and when it wins",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "id": "e0109"
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "seed": 48564088,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1580339019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1308,
   "y": 1474,
   "width": 763.5600000000001,
   "height": 35.0,
   "text": "Caching trades WRITE cost now for READ savings later. Materialising 5 809 rows into the block manager\ncosts more than simply re-scanning a small parquet file, so you never earn the investment back.",
   "originalText": "Caching trades WRITE cost now for READ savings later. Materialising 5 809 rows into the block manager\ncosts more than simply re-scanning a small parquet file, so you never earn the investment back.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "id": "e0110"
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "seed": 1292925356,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 615126837,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1308,
   "y": 1534,
   "width": 234.9,
   "height": 18.75,
   "text": "Cache when ALL of these hold:",
   "originalText": "Cache when ALL of these hold:",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "id": "e0111"
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "seed": 870050476,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 728457167,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1308,
   "y": 1560,
   "width": 673.9200000000001,
   "height": 48.75,
   "text": "  1. the lineage is expensive (joins, shuffles, wide aggregations) - not a plain file scan\n  2. you reuse it at least twice   3. it fits in memory  (Lab 2 cell [48] is the honest example:\n     one Silver DataFrame feeding four separate Gold tables)",
   "originalText": "  1. the lineage is expensive (joins, shuffles, wide aggregations) - not a plain file scan\n  2. you reuse it at least twice   3. it fits in memory  (Lab 2 cell [48] is the honest example:\n     one Silver DataFrame feeding four separate Gold tables)",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
