   "text": "small table -> copied whole to\n               every executor\nbig table   -> stays put, no shuffle\n\nYour run: 0.3436s -> 0.1789s\n           = 1.9x on 688 rows",
   "originalText": "small table -> copied whole to\n               every executor\nbig table   -> stays put, no shuffle\n\nYour run: 0.3436s -> 0.1789s\n           = 1.9x on 688 rows",
