   "type": "text",
   "x": 70,
   "y": 2415,
   "width": 748.44,
   "height": 35.0,
   "text": "Spark already auto-broadcasts anything under spark.sql.autoBroadcastJoinThreshold (10 MB default).\nBroadcasting something too large copies it to EVERY executor - a reliable way to OOM the whole job.",
   "originalText": "Spark already auto-broadcasts anything under spark.sql.autoBroadcastJoinThreshold (10 MB default).\nBroadcasting something too large copies it to EVERY executor - a reliable way to OOM the whole job.",
