   "text": "filter AFTER join (anti-pattern)   0.1890 s        filter BEFORE join (best practice)  0.1833 s\nwithout column pruning             0.1684 s        with column pruning                 0.2649 s",
   "originalText": "filter AFTER join (anti-pattern)   0.1890 s        filter BEFORE join (best practice)  0.1833 s\nwithout column pruning             0.1684 s        with column pruning                 0.2649 s",
