   "type": "text",
   "x": 1308,
   "y": 2392,
   "width": 763.5600000000001,
   "height": 52.5,
   "text": "This is not a broken lab. Catalyst had ALREADY pushed the filter down and pruned the columns before\neither version ran - you were hand-optimising a plan the optimiser had already rewritten identically.\nRead the plan to see what Catalyst did; hand-tune only what the plan shows it missed.",
   "originalText": "This is not a broken lab. Catalyst had ALREADY pushed the filter down and pruned the columns before\neither version ran - you were hand-optimising a plan the optimiser had already rewritten identically.\nRead the plan to see what Catalyst did; hand-tune only what the plan shows it missed.",
