   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 88,
   "y": 3306,
   "width": 723.0600000000001,
   "height": 48.75,
   "text": "Arrow has a fixed setup cost per batch. On 688 rows it never amortises. The ordering above is correct\nat scale - it is simply not observable here.  Also: pandas_udf needs pyarrow, and on Python 3.12 it\nneeds setuptools (distutils was removed) - without it the pipeline SKIPS the stage with only a WARNING.",
   "originalText": "Arrow has a fixed setup cost per batch. On 688 rows it never amortises. The ordering above is correct\nat scale - it is simply not observable here.  Also: pandas_udf needs pyarrow, and on Python 3.12 it\nneeds setuptools (distutils was removed) - without it the pipeline SKIPS the stage with only a WARNING.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
