   "type": "text",
   "x": 1290,
   "y": 2768,
   "width": 756.0,
   "height": 35.0,
   "text": "Each trigger appends new rows and Spark re-runs your query incrementally. The transformation code is\ncharacter-for-character the same as batch - that is the whole selling point.",
