   "x": 852,
   "y": 3925,
   "width": 365.04,
   "height": 65.0,
   "text": "Zero nulls is not luck: Lab 2's Silver layer already\nquarantined the 191 bad rows. This gate is the\nsecond line of defence, and it is where a schema\nchange or an upstream outage shows up first.",
