   "x": 1612,
   "y": 3915,
   "width": 365.04,
   "height": 65.0,
   "text": "Why bother: it lets you ask 'what tier was user 1 on\nthe day they bought?' - a question a plain UPDATE\ndestroys forever. Revenue attribution and auditing\nboth depend on being able to answer it.",
