   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1200,
   "y": 4488,
   "width": 625.86,
   "height": 23.75,
   "text": "The lesson - and it is the honest one to write in your report",
   "originalText": "The lesson - and it is the honest one to write in your report",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#e67700",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "id": "e0276"
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "seed": 2075511272,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1158592356,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1200,
   "y": 4524,
   "width": 567.0,
   "height": 56.25,
   "text": "Every optimisation has a FIXED COST and a VARIABLE SAVING.\nBelow some data size the fixed cost dominates and the optimisation\nis a pessimisation. 5 809 rows is far below that line for all but one.",
   "originalText": "Every optimisation has a FIXED COST and a VARIABLE SAVING.\nBelow some data size the fixed cost dominates and the optimisation\nis a pessimisation. 5 809 rows is far below that line for all but one.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "id": "e0277"
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "seed": 1217745516,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1271484262,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1200,
   "y": 4610,
   "width": 599.4000000000001,
   "height": 75.0,
   "text": "Broadcast won because its fixed cost is nearly zero. The rest lost because\nthey buy you something - pruning, reuse, vectorisation - that only pays\nback across gigabytes.  Do not conclude the techniques are wrong.\nConclude that you must MEASURE, at the size you will actually run.",
   "originalText": "Broadcast won because its fixed cost is nearly zero. The rest lost because\nthey buy you something - pruning, reuse, vectorisation - that only pays\nback across gigabytes.  Do not conclude the techniques are wrong.\nConclude that you must MEASURE, at the size you will actually run.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
