   "text": "What to carry into the project",
   "originalText": "What to carry into the project",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "id": "e0280"
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "seed": 672537884,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1755807441,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1200,
   "y": 4765,
   "width": 589.6800000000001,
   "height": 87.5,
   "text": "1. Read explain() before hand-tuning - Catalyst may already have done it.\n2. Partition on what you filter, at GB scale, never on a high-cardinality key.\n3. Cache only an expensive lineage you reuse 2+ times, then unpersist.\n4. Reach for built-ins; drop to pandas_udf only when you must; row UDFs last.\n5. Every streaming job gets a checkpointLocation. Not optional.",
   "originalText": "1. Read explain() before hand-tuning - Catalyst may already have done it.\n2. Partition on what you filter, at GB scale, never on a high-cardinality key.\n3. Cache only an expensive lineage you reuse 2+ times, then unpersist.\n4. Reach for built-ins; drop to pandas_udf only when you must; row UDFs last.\n5. Every streaming job gets a checkpointLocation. Not optional.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "id": "e0281"
  },
  {
